    "RDKit controls molecular layout, limiting precise placement for publication figures.",
    "Latest pyqtdarktheme dependency requires Python below 3.12; rdeditor itself requires 3.10 or newer.",
    "README says atom clicks add bonded atoms; current code replaces atoms and uses dragging to add them."
